    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/2ee23404271c3345a0469c85b214aa4d.poster.avif?t=1652905856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/2ee23404271c3345a0469c85b214aa4d.webm?t=1652905856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/2ee23404271c3345a0469c85b214aa4d.mp4?t=1652905856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>&quot;Unit 404&quot; is a sci-fi puzzle platformer game. Find a way out of the abandoned sci-fi complex through solving various puzzles. The game has more than 70 handcrafted levels with various game mechanics and visual themes. The difficulty keeps growing as you progress through the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/093975b0897b4e55a7b72ad19c0f6ddf.poster.avif?t=1652905856\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/093975b0897b4e55a7b72ad19c0f6ddf.webm?t=1652905856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1384960/extras/093975b0897b4e55a7b72ad19c0f6ddf.mp4?t=1652905856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
